@lang pt
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@nlg:en C1 keyword-first mixfix
`de` x `até` y MEANS x PLUS y

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@nlg:en C2 keyword-first with comma segment
`reclusão, de` x `até` y `anos, e multa` MEANS x PLUS y

GIVEN `o mínimo` IS A NUMBER
      `o máximo` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@nlg:en C3 backticked params
`pena de` `o mínimo` `até` `o máximo` `anos` MEANS `o mínimo` PLUS `o máximo`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
@nlg:en C4 param-first mixfix
x `somado a` y MEANS x PLUS y

#EVAL `de` 1 `até` 2
#EVAL `reclusão, de` 1 `até` 2 `anos, e multa`
#EVAL `pena de` 1 `até` 2 `anos`
#EVAL 1 `somado a` 2
